@startuml
title Gardener Booking System - Activity Diagram
start
:Gardener / admin sets availability;
:Customer logs in;
:Select appointment date;
:View gardener availability;
if (Slot available?) then (yes)
  :Select gardener and time slot;
  :Book appointment;
  :Central system confirms booking;
  :Update customer record;
  :Update gardener schedule;
  :Send confirmation;
else (no)
  :Show not available message;
  stop
endif
if (Cancel appointment?) then (yes)
  :Cancel appointment;
  :Release the slot;
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
